<title>USA: Fannie Mae sets $250 mln REMIC 1997-08.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets $250 mln REMIC 1997-08.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal National Mortgage Association (Fannie Mae or FNMA) said it issued $250 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-08, issued via Prudential Securities Inc, is backed by 30-year 7.0 percent mortgage-backed certificates, Fannie Mae said.</p>
<p>The issue has a pricing date of January 14 and a settlement date of January 30, the agency said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
